From 5e7023b3ef31d52961a8eca76ca7998ad4d3ebde Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Keith Packard <keithp@keithp.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 06:55:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 15/24] test-posix: Check the strtol family's subject, bases,
 EINVAL and ERANGE

---
